{"step_index":349,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-15T01:02:20Z","content":"Created At: 2026-09-15T10:02:20+09:00\nCompleted At: 2026-09-15T10:02:23+09:00\nThe search for \"\"051-642-1525\" OR \"수영로39번길 35\"\" returned the following summary:\n부산광역시 남구 수영로39번길 35(문현동)에 위치한 건물에는 **기러기문화원**을 비롯하여 여러 기관과 단체가 입주해 있습니다.\n\n문의하신 전화번호 **051-642-1525**는 과거 **한국투명성기구 부산지역본부**의 연락처로 확인되었습니다[1][2][3].\n\n해당 주소(수영로39번길 35)에 위치한 주요 시설 및 기관은 다음과 같습니다:\n*   **기러기문화원**[4][5][6]\n*   **부산광역시 남구자원봉사센터**[7][5]\n*   **문현마을문고**[8][9]\n*   **좋은이웃지역아동센터**[10]\n*   **코리아학원**[11][5]\n*   **문현지겟골장학회**[4][12]\n\n방문하시려는 목적에 따라 위 기관 중 하나인지 확인해 보시기 바랍니다.\n\nSources:\n[1] [hf.go.kr](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQE57kW5TwiMNobDRAsVIOT6bgfuu8l2PnDt2pCUKk24j-nTc68jpEbCRTT_AAwkMSB7fX5xY4YitksaD47ztgDr3eB3azIpHt4SNdg18NQujRUTb3S47jYrFWSKTalvV8CNUipO93-UKjmcksd6w9zT3A==)\n[2] [haeundae.go.kr](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGkKm3fhGDzWYCt8xbyCot6_WawCCWWBHdHFPdg4TlnoC0E9pLo7d4aTTTwLfwGk2ECy7yQy9wAlhZiEkUA2On901euP6k_cjf1KgC2KmX6ADUgwb2vX77Pvtsy1ayAmCp4J1PjhXaUY9ndSRCyaetaqwkqWzVGW7zVKLOsU5hnQFe8qyIg-6grnfyGC9tYmuR0pg9frK4-uw==)\n[3] [haeundae.go.kr](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGTgaC3fzY5aLa896v5rAQPIlKfkDS5VD5D0Zcuu8jLvMd6PrpiV_kGFlyvJbUYlodJ1UVHDdxxLV4A8JjWCQmSEoDw_bkJcA51b_qQlQwqWqhFkq7wTK6UoA6CgS_umsz2c0xALmc8avFAnpWkJ7xK-GDw0Dwt4toUTTwNkSxmCB3Djfz8ERP53hlcrSJTV59mztbJKzDBPzepg9qFvKX-yCzpJv9J-3AM02bafGcZbu8ErcyjaqXFEowjl0a-KQ5aqaJHQ3iBA5Z-IYuW5K0JP21jqB2PwHiELatXxh8JlOVq)\n[4] [jigetgolship.co.kr](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFDZTC_nH7jrmlYmwXDi4oUmE4RIaNrzQNM8R4fiyZaBp6B270rBZwHU2sW4T1PwtHGOrVyZ9Ut_D0n5_zd0D4VWz3lKeXyfw1l8aUe5lrSFQRxXU8VzTPGxZWDHkb57139ham7_OQ=)\n[5] [jobkorea.co.kr](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQE5m5_DvLzCmsaLfnOnKXy3xxz8BzL4hjXWhHWbaH2YC6YM4tA-FY5yJW